#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:11
msgid "Plugin basics"
msgstr "插件基础"

#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:14
msgid "What is a plugin?"
msgstr "什么是插件？"

#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:17
msgid ""
"A plugin extends the build definition, most commonly by adding new settings "
"and tasks. For example, a plugin could add `githubWorkflowGenerate` task to "
"generate GitHub Actions YAML."
msgstr ""
"插件扩展构建定义，最常见的方式是添加新的设置和任务。例如，插件可以添加 "
"`githubWorkflowGenerate` 任务来生成 GitHub Actions YAML。"

#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:20
msgid "Finding the plugin versions using Scaladex"
msgstr "使用 Scaladex 查找插件版本"

#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:23
msgid ""
"You can use [Scaladex](https://index.scala-lang.org/search?platform=sbt2) to "
"search for plugins, and find out the latest version of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 [Scaladex](https://index.scala-lang.org/search?platform=sbt2) 搜索"
"插件，并查找插件的最新版本。"

#: src/reference/guide/plugin-basics.md:25
msgid "Declaring a plugin"
msgstr "声明插件"

